[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5247458876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5247458876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5247458876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOMXePA","user":{"login":"Hiiamwilliam","id":62215077,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjE1MDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62215077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiiamwilliam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T00:06:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T00:06:04Z","body":"I tested these steps in both 4.7-beta1 and 4.7.1-stable and did not manage to reproduce, can Paint normally in Perspective, Orthogonal, and switching between.\n\nIf the picture included represents exactly the moment of bug, then it's because the GridMap menu (bottom right) is open, which eats one click Input when trying to Paint.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5247458876/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5257875663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5257875663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5257875663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOWTQzw","user":{"login":"wyattbiker","id":930478,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDQ3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker","html_url":"https://github.com/wyattbiker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T19:31:17Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T19:31:17Z","body":"Upgraded to Godot 4.7.1 Linux version. \n\nOne of my tests was with downloaded  gridmap demo https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs-project-starters/releases/download/latest-4.x/gridmap_starter.zip\n\nI open up and dragged the MeshLibrary that came with it to Gridmap. Clicking on Gridmap node I selected some meshes from the library painted them in Perspective. When I switched to Orhogonal, I got crickets. Going back to Perspective worked fine.\n\nNow I also tried new projects. Same issues. Here is an example of a project with video capture.\n\n[Archive.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30948900/Archive.zip)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e3ebcba-e6b3-4088-ae6c-35b788df9056","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5257875663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5260324321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5260324321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5260324321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOYot4Q","user":{"login":"Hiiamwilliam","id":62215077,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjE1MDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62215077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiiamwilliam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T00:06:45Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T00:06:45Z","body":"Hmm, I still cannot reproduce, even with your example project. \nDo post your system information (top left menu: Help > Copy System Info). It could be hardware or X11/Wayland related.\n\nThe video has two points:\n1) Output indicates Errors before you even do anything. What are they? They could be related, as I don't have any (even on your example project);\n2) When you switch to Orthogonal, notice how the orange grid doesn't follow the mouse anymore, even if you can change Viewport zoom. This would mean Viewport is not sending Input to GridMap. However, GridMap is still responding (when you switch to Erase Mode the indicator cube, immobile, becomes red).\n\nNot sure if this helps diagnosing anything, but:\n1) Try changing from Perspective to Orthogonal using keyboard shortcuts instead of using that menu. \n2) Test the same procedure with other Nodes e.g. Path3D node. Try adding Curve points in Perspective, then Orthogonal. If you can, then points to something specific to GridMap. If not, it's something more widespread.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5260324321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5262945653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5262945653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5262945653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABObItdQ","user":{"login":"wyattbiker","id":930478,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDQ3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker","html_url":"https://github.com/wyattbiker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T05:57:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T06:02:19Z","body":"Here are specs:\n`Godot v4.7.1.stable - Ubuntu 25.10 25.10 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1260P (16 threads) - 15.30 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)`\n\nPath3D works fine in bothe Ortho and Perspective. I am using a laptop that doesn't have a Keypad so can't relly test menus with keyboard,\n\nHere is a Gridmap video with two viewports Ortho vs Perspective\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16b85a06-47da-4097-b8b1-69c6fd386b8c\n\n\nTested with Godots 4.3  version of older style Gridmap. Works fine with that.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/023440a7-e7a1-40d8-b298-ac3d26e64f6c\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5262945653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5271595822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5271595822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5271595822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOjYrLg","user":{"login":"Hiiamwilliam","id":62215077,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjE1MDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62215077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiiamwilliam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T19:13:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T19:13:05Z","body":"> I am using a laptop that doesn't have a Keypad so can't relly test menus with keyboard\n\nThere is an option for that: Editor Settings > Editors > 3D > Navigation > Emulate Numpad\n\nIt should give some handy shortcuts, but probably won't help in this specific bug.\n\n---\nNow, it's good that you tested 4.3 and noticed it works there. It means two things:\n1) It's (maybe) not a hardware issue;\n2) Some change after 4.3.stable has caused this issue.\n\nUnfortunately, given I can't replicate, you'll have to do some work to find out which change caused this.\nYou'll need to download and test different Godot versions after 4.3.stable until you find out which one shows this incorrect behavior. Then it will be easier to find out exactly which code update caused this.\n\nI would start by testing the last stable versions: 4.4.1, 4.5.2, 4.6.3. The first post is already 4.7 so it has to be before that.\nIf, let's say, 4.5.2 shows the wrong behavior, but 4.4.1 doesn't, then you'll need to test the versions in-between. \nYou can download the previous versions here: https://godotengine.org/download/archive/","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5271595822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5274262423","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5274262423","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5274262423,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOl7blw","user":{"login":"wyattbiker","id":930478,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDQ3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker","html_url":"https://github.com/wyattbiker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T00:09:30Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T00:09:30Z","body":"Found the issue. Don't even ask how I stumbled on it. My head is spinning.  I only tested with 4.7.1. But I think I tested down to 4.4 and issues was present..\n\nThe problem has to do with the Scene `View > Settings: View Z-far` setting I had defaulted it too far to 20000 in Editor 3D settings. When I set it to 4000 Ortho mode view worked just fine. Not sure what the limits are. Iff you create a new scene, the View Z-far affects Gridmap. Also if you change the Z-Far.\n\n<img width=\"1915\" height=\"1118\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59f8a85f-2f00-467e-8d1d-f67b6783bc0b\" />\n\nAlso here is a video showing. Let me know if you want me to test anything else.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f162daff-2d60-47e9-a449-f9cbf5407f71\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5274262423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5283927592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5283927592","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5283927592,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOvJWKA","user":{"login":"Hiiamwilliam","id":62215077,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjE1MDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62215077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/Hiiamwilliam","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hiiamwilliam/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T17:08:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T17:08:15Z","body":"Ah, nice! That is indeed what causes the problems. When I set that parameter to 20.000 I can now reproduce the non-responsiveness.\n\nThe reason this happens is that when the Viewport Camera is set to Orthogonal, its Transform changes (its distance to origin changes). GridMap Editor Plugin has some code that checks if Input intersects the editing plane. \nThat distance seems to be related to the Z-Far, so large Z-Far values results in Input not reaching the editing plane. \n\nGiven the culprit was found, I don't think you need to test anything else. Now it's up to someone with more knowledge on Camera code to do the required updates. Or, to update the intersection check to consider the Perspective/Orthogonal distance.\n\nAt most, I would suggest updating the first post and/or title to include \"very large Z-Far\".\n\n---\n\nNote: this is not a regression. The code that checks for intersection hasn't been changed from Godot 3. \nThe problem lies on Camera changing its distance in Orthogonal mode. I found a somewhat related proposal: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12388","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5283927592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5285210835","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122219#issuecomment-5285210835","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122219","id":5285210835,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOwXq0w","user":{"login":"wyattbiker","id":930478,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDQ3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930478?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker","html_url":"https://github.com/wyattbiker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wyattbiker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T19:08:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T19:08:26Z","body":"I'll update the title and leave it open. Thanks for your input.!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5285210835/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]